TowerScout YOLO-Enabled Release Licensing

This file states the licenses for the TowerScout YOLO-enabled release track.
Individual third-party notices remain in force.

TowerScout application and supporting material:

The project-controlled application code, supporting code and accompanying
documentation identified in
licenses/TowerScout-APPLICATION-GRANT.md is additionally licensed under the
GNU Affero General Public License, version 3 (AGPL-3.0-only). This includes
inherited CC-marked application code, modifications and extracted modules.
Recipients may use this code under AGPL-3.0 without also applying the CC
noncommercial/share-alike conditions to that AGPL-licensed use.

Previously granted CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0 permissions remain available as an
alternative, and existing Apache-2.0 grants remain effective where applicable.
The October 25, 2026 scope clarification covers project-controlled build,
launcher, packaging, CI/test/development support and accompanying documentation.
It does not supply an otherwise unconfirmed Apache-2.0 grant. This additional grant does not newly
license inherited CC material under Apache-2.0. Preserve author attribution.
Complete terms, warranty disclaimers and limitations of liability are in
licenses/AGPL-3.0.txt, licenses/Apache-2.0.txt and
licenses/CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0.txt. Third-party code, model weights, data and provider
services are outside this additional application grant.

YOLO-enabled distribution:

The current detector runtime includes Ultralytics YOLOv5 source code vendored
under webapp/vendor/yolov5_local/. That source is governed by the GNU Affero
General Public License, Version 3.0, as shown in
webapp/vendor/yolov5_local/LICENSE and licenses/AGPL-3.0.txt. The YOLO-enabled package and container
image are therefore distributed with AGPL-3.0 obligations. Do not describe the
full YOLO-enabled runtime distribution as Apache-2.0-only.

Model and data assets:

Model weights and ZIP-code data are governed by the model and data terms in
MODEL_LICENSES.md and DATA_LICENSES.md. The YOLO detector weights are treated
as YOLO-derived/AGPL-governed for this release track unless a separate written
model license or permission record says otherwise.
The EfficientNet classifier weights retain CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0, including its
noncommercial and share-alike conditions. See MODEL_LICENSES.md and the full
text in licenses/CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0.txt. The application grant does not relicense
those weights or make the complete model-enabled distribution unrestricted.

Provider terms:

Google Maps, Azure Maps, and any other provider APIs are external services.
Their terms are not granted by this repository license. See PROVIDER_TERMS.md.

Release notices:

See NOTICE and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for the source offer, third-party
attribution, and package-level compliance notes.
